Silo — Object Storage dashboard
===============================

This repository contains a derivative work of the community dashboard "MinIO
Metrics v3 Grafana Dashboard", published by Federico Antoniazzi and
contributed to by Adam Charnock.

  Original work: minio-grafana-dashboard-metrics-v3
  Author:        Federico Antoniazzi
  Contributor:   Adam Charnock
  Source:        https://github.com/FedericoAntoniazzi/minio-grafana-dashboard-metrics-v3
  Forked from:   main @ 5ba0fb4072b2fecbabff2cedfdcb9cb58f9798a4
  Licence:       Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE)

`dashboard.json` at the root of this repository is the original file, copied
unmodified from the fork point above. The derivative work is
`silo/dashboard.json`; it is the only file that was changed.

The original dashboard is itself based on the "MinIO Dashboard" (#13502)
published on the Grafana dashboard marketplace:
https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/13502-minio-dashboard/

The original work contains no NOTICE file, so there is no upstream NOTICE to
reproduce here. The terms of the Apache License, Version 2.0 apply to the
original work and to this modified version of it.

